      ":question/worked-solution": "The equation of our parabola is \n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=25x.\n$$\n\nFinally, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(25x) \\\\ 2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =25 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{25}{2y}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
